# Eastern Plaguelands (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# 9 Horde quests (band 50-60, census docs/eastern-plaguelands-horde-census.md).
# Every Horde accept in the local census appears exactly once as an accept and
# once as a turnin. Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-accept in file
# order. Out-of-contract pres (5229/5231/5233/5235 and 5902 from Tirisfal,
# 5021 shared from the main guide, 4985 shared, 6568 from Stonetalon) ride
# dedicated when onquest mini-steps, each standing alone; out-of-contract
# chain exits (5049, 6582, 5237) get handoff notes. The rogue block
# (1886/1898/1978/1998/1999/2378) is Undercity-contracted and never duplicated
# here. Sourceless items ride bag-note completes, never invented points.
# Expedition legs (Undercity, Thunder Bluff, Dustwallow) switch frames
# deliberately and switch back. Coordinates use the pack era qualifier; every
# goto/complete is written from the local Forever data.
guide butler-routes-completionist/eastern-plaguelands-horde
title Eastern Plaguelands (Horde)
levels 50-60
zone Eastern Plaguelands
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Eastern Kingdoms
coords live
version 1

step The Bulwark - arrival

  zone map 1422

  note The Horde works out of the Bulwark in the west - Vandis and Mickey hold the turn-ins, the cauldron fields and the Termite Barrel lie east.
  note Four Target quests (5229/5231/5233/5235) and the plague pair (5901/5902) accept from Vandis and Mickey on the Tirisfal side - unguided legs, take them there if you want the full chain; each Bulwark return below fires only holding its Target.
  note 5236's next (5237, Mission Accomplished!) is Alliance-only - the Horde cauldron fork ends at 5236's turn-in.

step Felstone return (soft pre)

  zone map 1422

  when onquest 5229

  tip Holding 5229 (Target: Felstone Field, from Vandis on the Tirisfal side): the Felstone cauldron takes the return here.
  accept 5230 -- Return to the Bulwark - Scourge Cauldron; the filled bottle goes back to Vandis
  note Have the Filled Felstone Field Bottle (item 13190, no placed source in the data) in your bags - it rode 5229's line.
  turnin 5230 @26.40,59.10 era -- Return to the Bulwark - the bottle to Vandis at the Bulwark

