step A Plague Upon Thee (soft pre)

  zone map 1422

  when onquest 5902

  tip Holding 5902 (A Plague Upon Thee, from Mickey Levine on the Tirisfal side, after 5901): the Termite Barrel takes the Horde fork here.
  accept 6390 -- A Plague Upon Thee - Termite Barrel; Mickey Levine hears of it at the Bulwark
  note Have the Barrel of Plagueland Termites (item 15044, no placed source in the data) in your bags - it rode 5902's line.
  turnin 6390 @26.70,59.60 era -- A Plague Upon Thee - the barrel's word to Mickey Levine at the Bulwark

step Darrowshire - the parcel (soft pre)

  zone map 1422

  when onquest 5021

  tip Holding 5021 (Better Late Than Never, Janice Felstone's neutral pre from the main guide): her parcel takes the Horde fork here.
  accept 5023 -- Better Late Than Never - Janice's Parcel; Bauhaus waits in Undercity
  note Bauhaus offers 5049 (The Jeremiah Blues, Undercity accept, uncontracted) after this - take it if you want the chain; its turn-in is Jeremiah Payson in Undercity. The turn-in below rides the Undercity expedition.

step Mulgris - the oaken branch (soft pre)

  zone map 1422

  when onquest 4985

  tip Holding 4985 (The Wildlife Suffers Too, from Mulgris's shared line in the main guide): the branch takes the Horde fork here.
  accept 4987 -- Glyphed Oaken Branch - Mulgris Deepriver; Nara Wildmane waits in Thunder Bluff
  note Have the Glyphed Oaken Branch (item 12663, no placed source in the data) in your bags - it rode 4985's line. The turn-in rides the Thunder Bluff expedition.

step Myranda - oculus and ember (soft pre)

  zone map 1422

  when onquest 6568

  tip Holding 6568 (The Testament of Rexxar, from Stonetalon, uncontracted above-band there): Myranda the Hag takes the chain here.
  accept 6569 -- Oculus Illusions - Myranda the Hag; Black Dragonspawn Eyes, then Emberstrife
  complete 6569 -- Black Dragonspawn Eye x20 (no placed dropper anywhere in the data - farm Black dragonspawn where found)
  turnin 6569 @50.79,77.85 era -- Oculus Illusions - the eyes to Myranda
  accept 6570 -- Emberstrife - Myranda the Hag; the amulet rides to Dustwallow
  note Have the Amulet of Draconic Subversion (item 16787, no placed source in the data) in your bags. The turn-in rides the Dustwallow expedition; 6582 (The Test of Skulls, Dustwallow accept, uncontracted) follows it - take it there if you want the chain.

step Expedition - the Undercity leg

  zone Undercity

  when onquest 5023

  note One trip east for the parcel's end - and Bauhaus's follow-up is noted, never duplicated.
  turnin 5023 @69.79,43.16 era -- Better Late Than Never - the parcel to Royal Overseer Bauhaus
  note 5049 (The Jeremiah Blues) accepts from Bauhaus here, uncontracted - take it if you want the chain; Jeremiah Payson stands in this city.

  zone map 1422

step Expedition - the Thunder Bluff leg

  zone Thunder Bluff

  when onquest 4987

  note West for the branch's end - one turn-in, then back east.
  turnin 4987 @75.65,31.61 era -- Glyphed Oaken Branch - the branch to Nara Wildmane

  zone map 1422

step Expedition - the Dustwallow leg

  zone Dustwallow Marsh

  when onquest 6570

  note South across the sea for Emberstrife - one turn-in, then home.
  turnin 6570 @56.66,87.72 era -- Emberstrife - the amulet to Emberstrife
  note 6582 (The Test of Skulls, Dustwallow accept, uncontracted) follows here - take it if you want the chain.

  zone map 1422
